{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_7", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_7.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "DOCTOR", "names": ["DOCTOR"], "gender": "?", "first": 33, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "This tale about the water supply, is it true?", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Certainly it is true, but how did you come to hear it?", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil (coming in).", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra ran in on her way to the school\u2014", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Did she?", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes; and she declares that\u2014I thought she was only making a fool of me\u2014but it isn't like Petra to do that.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Of course not.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "How could you imagine such a thing!", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh well, it is better never to trust anybody; you may find you have been made a fool of before you know where you are.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "But it is really true, all the same?", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "You can depend upon it that it is true.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Won't you sit down?", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "(Settles him on the couch.)", "para": 7, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Isn't it a real bit of luck for the town\u2014", "para": 7, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil (suppressing his laughter).", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "A bit of luck for the town?", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, that I made the discovery in good time.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil (as before).", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, yes.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes!\u2014But I should never have thought you the sort of man to pull your own brother's leg like this!", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Pull his leg!", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Really, father dear\u2014", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil (resting his hands and his chin on the handle of his stick and winking slyly at the DOCTOR).", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Let me see, what was the story?", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Some kind of beast that had got into the water-pipes, wasn't it?", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Infusoria\u2014yes.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "And a lot of these beasts had got in, according to Petra\u2014a tremendous lot.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Certainly; hundreds of thousands of them, probably.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "But no one can see them\u2014isn't that so?", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes; you can't see them,", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil (with a quiet chuckle).", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Damn\u2014it's the finest story I have ever heard!", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "What do you mean?", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "But you will never get the Mayor to believe a thing like that.", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "We shall see.", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you think he will be fool enough to\u2014?", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "I hope the whole town will be fools enough.", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "The whole town!", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, it wouldn't be a bad thing.", "para": 25, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "It would just serve them right, and teach them a lesson.", "para": 25, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "They think themselves so much cleverer than we old fellows.", "para": 25, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "They hounded me out of the council; they did, I tell you\u2014they hounded me out.", "para": 25, "sent": 5, "present": [0]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Now they shall pay for it.", "para": 25, "sent": 6, "present": [0]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "You pull their legs too, Thomas!", "para": 25, "sent": 7, "present": [0]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "Really, I\u2014", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "You pull their legs!", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "(Gets up.)", "para": 27, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "If you can work it so that the Mayor and his friends all swallow the same bait, I will give ten pounds to a charity\u2014like a shot!", "para": 27, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "That is very kind of you.", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, I haven't got much money to throw away, I can tell you; but, if you can work this, I will give five pounds to a charity at Christmas.", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "(HOVSTAD comes in by the hall door.)", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Good morning!", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "(Stops.)", "para": 31, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, I beg your pardon", "para": 31, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Not at all; come in.", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil (with another chuckle).", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Oho!\u2014is he in this too?", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "What do you mean?", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Certainly he is.", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "I might have known it!", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "It must get into the papers.", "para": 36, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "You know how to do it, Thomas!", "para": 36, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "Set your wits to work.", "para": 36, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Now I must go.", "para": 36, "sent": 5, "present": [0]}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Won't you stay a little while?", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "No, I must be off now.", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "You keep up this game for all it is worth; you won't repent it, I'm damned if you will!", "para": 38, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "(He goes out; MRS. STOCKMANN follows him into the hall.)", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (laughing).", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "Just imagine\u2014the old chap doesn't believe a word of all this about the water supply.", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh that was it, then?", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, that was what we were talking about.", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "Perhaps it is the same thing that brings you here?", "para": 42, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, it is, Can you spare me a few minutes, Doctor?", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "As long as you like, my dear fellow.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}]}